					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This was the article that started the GOI Format revival, and at one point it was the third highest rated GOI Format on the site &#8212; that later formats have since overtaken it is just a sign that the efforts to get people to read and write more GOI Formats were wildly successful. Still, it's nice to see this hit triple digits finally.</p> 
				 	]]>
