				<wikidot:authorName>GreenWolf</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1814684</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is a Prometheus Labs GOI format article. In fact, it's only the second PL GOI format article on site. <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/grant-request-for-usage-of-biological-organisms-to-facilitat">(The first one can be found here.)</a></p> <p>Thanks go out to the following people:</p> <ul> <li>A Random Day - For creating the GOI format used here, and for reviewing the draft.</li> <li>TwistedGears - For telling me to write a PL thing, even if he wanted me to do a tale or skip.</li> <li>augmentedspartan - For crit</li> <li>minmin -For crit</li> <li>DrKens - For crit</li> <li>Athena_Grey - For crit</li> <li>Randomini - For crit</li> <li>Adamu-sama - For crit</li> </ul> <p>If I forgot you, give me a poke and I'll add you to the list.</p> <p>The magic used in the magitech here was borrowed from Clef's GOC stuff. <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/goc-supplemental-thaumatology">You can find his explanations of it here.</a></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
